{"type":"text","timestamp":1778976893131,"sessionID":"ses_1ccb71acfffePYPEX97Uqgm6bA","part":{"id":"prt_e334918d0001RDMqbfEvXrD49e","messageID":"msg_e33490c13001ihP6vka0dcNmhK","sessionID":"ses_1ccb71acfffePYPEX97Uqgm6bA","type":"text","text":"The issue is clear: create a new `preneoplastic lesion` term as a child of `MONDO:0021074 precancerous condition`, not as a synonym or child of pre-malignant neoplasm. I’m checking existing ontology context, applicable pattern guidance, and the cited literature before minting the term.","time":{"start":1778976889040,"end":1778976893129}}}
