{"type":"text","timestamp":1778977110754,"sessionID":"ses_1ccb71acfffePYPEX97Uqgm6bA","part":{"id":"prt_e334c661b001WUNY22aQd4cgZb","messageID":"msg_e334c5f2c001PO2Hvsv51yzFWn","sessionID":"ses_1ccb71acfffePYPEX97Uqgm6bA","type":"text","text":"Implemented issue `#9781` locally.\n\nWhat changed:\n- Added new term `MONDO:7770012` `preneoplastic lesion`\n- Set parent to `MONDO:0021074` `precancerous condition`\n- Added a definition aligned with the issue discussion and distinct from `pre-malignant neoplasm`\n- Added issue tracker metadata linking back to `#9781`\n\nCommit:\n- `08b2101` `Add preneoplastic lesion term`\n\nFiles created and left uncommitted as requested:\n- `ISSUE_COMMENTS.md`\n- `PR_COMMENTS.md`\n\nValidation:\n- Confirmed the issue discussion supports creating a new child term under `precancerous condition`\n- Checked relevant existing MONDO terms and ensured `MONDO:7770012` was unused\n- Verified cited PMIDs via PubMed lookups\n- Ran `robot convert --catalog src/ontology/catalog-v001.xml -i src/ontology/mondo-edit.obo -f obo -o src/ontology/mondo-edit.TMP.obo` successfully as a syntax check\n\nConstraint:\n- I could not run the repo’s preferred ODK normalization step (`make NORM`) because `docker` is not available in this environment. I documented that in `PR_COMMENTS.md`.","time":{"start":1778977105435,"end":1778977110752}}}
